flowchart LR
    A[Search caller] --> B[BetterTogether::Search]
    B --> C[Adapter registry]
    C --> F[PgSearch backend - default]
    C --> E[Database backend - fallback]
    C --> X[Extension backend, for example better_together-elasticsearch]
    B --> G[Search::Registry]
    G --> H[Searchable models]
    H --> I[Shared Searchable contract]
    I --> J[as_indexed_json plain-text payload]
    I --> K[pg_search scope when configured]
    F --> K
    F --> E
    E --> J
    X --> J
    K --> L[SQL-backed matches]
    E --> M[Fallback record scoring]
    X --> N[External index]
    L --> O[SearchResult]
    M --> O
    N --> O
